@startuml SWR-PH1_usecase
left to right direction
title Phase 1 유스케이스 — OEM-FR-001 / OEM-FR-007 (VJ-ECL-2026)

actor "운전자" as Driver
actor "물리 버튼" as PhysicalButton
actor "AVN" as AVN
actor "음성 인식" as Voice
actor "모바일 앱" as MobileApp
actor "차량 (Ignition)" as Vehicle

Driver --> PhysicalButton
Driver --> AVN
Driver --> Voice
Driver --> MobileApp

rectangle "차일드락 제어 SW (Phase 1)" {
  usecase "좌/우/전체 잠금·해제 명령 수신·검증·적용\n(SWR-001, SWR-002, SWR-004)" as UC1
  usecase "Ignition-Off 시 논리 출력 강제 해제\n(SWR-020)" as UC2
}

PhysicalButton --> UC1 : OEM-IF-004
AVN --> UC1 : OEM-IF-004
Voice --> UC1 : OEM-IF-004
MobileApp --> UC1 : OEM-IF-004
Vehicle --> UC2 : OEM-IF-009 (ignition_on)

note bottom of UC2
  UC2가 산출하는 출력(RELEASE)은
  같은 평가주기의 UC1 산출값보다
  항상 우선 적용된다 (§8 상충 해소).
end note
@enduml
